---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Ghana Lease Agreement Template Pack" description="Complete set of lease agreements for residential, commercial, month-to-month, and room rentals.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/products/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Products</a>

      <h1>Ghana Lease Agreement Template Pack</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Complete set of legally sound lease agreements for all property types. Residential, commercial, furnished, month-to-month, and room rentals. All templates comply with Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 (Act 220) and L.I. 369.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Residential Lease (12 months):</strong> Standard annual agreement with Act 220 provisions</li>
          <li><strong>Commercial Lease:</strong> For business premises with special clauses</li>
          <li><strong>Furnished Apartment Lease:</strong> Inventory and condition provisions</li>
          <li><strong>Month-to-Month Agreement:</strong> Flexible short-term rental agreement</li>
          <li><strong>Room Rental Agreement:</strong> For shared houses and single rooms</li>
          <li><strong>DOCX Format:</strong> Fully editable Word templates for customization</li>
          <li><strong>PDF Format:</strong> Professional PDF versions for printing and signing</li>
          <li><strong>Act 220 Compliance:</strong> All templates include required legal provisions</li>
          <li><strong>Excel Tracker (Agency):</strong> Track all agreements and renewal dates</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Cards:</strong> 5 marketing cards (Agency tier only)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;">
        <h2>Choose Your Tier</h2>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Basic</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Essential agreements for landlords with a few rental units.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 49</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>2 agreements (DOCX + PDF)</li>
              <li>Residential + Commercial</li>
              <li>Act 220 compliant</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/68rdh61h87" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Pro</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Professional suite with all major agreement types.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 99</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>4 agreements (DOCX + PDF)</li>
              <li>Residential, Commercial, Furnished, Month-to-Month</li>
              <li>Customizable templates</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/13bi2h25kh" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Agency</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Complete package with all agreement types and management tools.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 199</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>5 agreements (DOCX + PDF)</li>
              <li>All rental types covered</li>
              <li>Excel tracker</li>
              <li>5 WhatsApp cards</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/238385f830" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
