        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Residential Lease Agreement:</strong> 12-month lease for residential properties with Act 220 provisions</li>
          <li><strong>Commercial Lease Agreement:</strong> For shops, offices, and business premises</li>
          <li><strong>Furnished Apartment Lease:</strong> Includes inventory checklist and condition clauses</li>
          <li><strong>Month-to-Month Tenancy Agreement:</strong> Flexible short-term rentals</li>
          <li><strong>Room Rental Agreement:</strong> For single rooms in shared houses (Pro & Agency only)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Act 220 & L.I. 369 Compliant:</strong> All agreements include mandatory provisions from Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 and associated regulations. Legally binding and dispute-proof.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Have Questions? Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
